00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:32.132 line:78%
CHINA'S MARKETS TO THE

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:34.367 line:78%
UNITED STATES" AND "PLAINLY

00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:35.935 line:78%
ADVANCE THE CAUSE OF PEACE IN

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.503 line:78%
ASIA AND THE CAUSE OF CHANGE IN

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:38.238 line:78%
CHINA."

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:39.339 line:78%
IN HIS LAST YEAR IN OFFICE,

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:41.241 line:78%
