00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:49.149 line:78%
PROJECT.

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:50.617 line:78%
FAST FORWARD TO TODAY, CHINA HAS

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:52.719 line:78%
